<title>USA: Sun Media Corp sets $150 mln 144A snr sub notes.</title>
<headline>Sun Media Corp sets $150 mln 144A snr sub notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Sun Media Corp was priced on Thursday in the private placement market, according to lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER SUN MEDIA CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 2/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD  9.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 314 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PERCENT AT 109.50</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
